      "content": "Thanks for the draft. It's a good start, but honestly, it feels a bit too clinical. It's very factual, which is fine, but looking at our sentiment score, it's coming back quite low—it's almost neutral. \n\nWe need it to feel much more \"moving\" so it passes the filter and catches the donors' attention. Could you try a second version that's more emotionally resonant? \n\nAgain, I really don't want it to be a melodrama or sound like a cheap scam, so please don't overdo the super dramatic adjectives or become hysterical. Just try to lean into the beauty of the reef and the tragedy of losing it. We just need to get that positivity/emotion score up a bit so the board sees it as 'inspiring' rather than just a report. Can you give it another shot?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
